%open_issue NixosServicesModuleDoesNotSetRestock
  what:     nix/services/nixos-services.nix builds its own environment for the backend and sets neither RESTOCK_ON_VOID nor RESTOCK_ON_REFUND
  why:      nix/containers.nix sets both from nix/stock-policy.nix since 2026-10-10, in the image Env and in its systemd environment. nixos-services.nix also reads a package option it never declares and sets no Postgres variables, so it looks unused. Confirm, then delete it or bring it in line.
  blocking: container and NixOS service deployment
  affects:  loadConfig, envRestockPolicy

%open_issue LogEnvironmentLabelAndIntervalText
  what:     Every log line carries env production in dev and test runs, and the startup line prints the token rotation interval as 900ss
  why:      Seen in backend/cheeblr.log on 2026-10-09. Where the label is set has not been read. backend/cheeblr.log was tracked in git until that day; it is now ignored. test-sale still writes its log there because the harness does not set LOG_FILE.
  blocking: nothing
  affects:  loadConfig


